// One of the player's fast Hammerheads ("transport test" scenario, 5.65 tiles/s) alone, traced every step (# fmtrace):
// out of the pack across the bay, back, then re-ordered under way - how it steers along its waypoints without
// other ships in the way.
wait_until(0.1min)
cmd("fmove go 1 64 75 1 80 64")
cmd("fmove trace 0")
wait_until(0.3min)
cmd("fmove go 1 80 64 3 62 70")
cmd("fmove trace 0")
wait_until(0.36min)
cmd("fmove go 1 76 66 6 74 80")
cmd("fmove trace 0")
wait_until(0.55min)
